[86.859575, "o", "High-rate remote entanglement between photon and matter-based qubits is essential for dis-\r\ntributed quantum information processing. A key technique to increase the modest entangling rates\r\n"]
[86.859616, "o", "of existing long-distance quantum networking approaches is multiplexing. Here, we demonstrate\r\na temporally multiplexed ion-photon interface via rapid transport of a chain of nine calcium ions\r\nacross 74µm within 86µs. The non-classical nature of the multiplexed photons is verified by mea-\r\n"]
